.TH bap-upgrade 1  "bap-upgrade " 
.SH NAME
bap\-upgrade \- Update bap to the latest GitHub release
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbap\-upgrade\fR [\fB\-\-version\fR] [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Update bap to the latest GitHub release
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-version\fR \fI<VERSION>\fR
Upgrade to this exact tag instead of latest
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Show what would happen without changing anything
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
